ures/*.mycad` は T07-T09 で API 経由で必ずパースされる(パースできなければ期待する 422 が出ず test fail)ため、入力形状の妥当性は API テストで担保済み。`Document` の YAML roundtrip 安定性は `mycad-format` の既存 roundtrip テストが所有。クロスクレートの roundtrip 追加は「テストは所有クレートに置く」規約に反するため行わない。fixture は最小に保つ。\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6514:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3531:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3327:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1834:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1215:crates/mycad-kernel/src/primitives/cylinder.rs:180:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6515:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3532:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3328:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1835:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1244:    /// T01: Determinism — identical inputs produce identical solids (field-by-field).\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6516:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3533:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3329:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1836:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1272:    /// T02: Topology counts.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6517:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3534:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3330:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1837:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1291:    /// T03: Euler–Poincaré formula V - E + F = 2(S - H), S=1, H=0 → 2.\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6518:features/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:3535:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review-2.md:3331:features/18-api-skeleton/final-review.md:1838:features/18-api-skeleton/design-review-3.md:1310:    /// T04: Manifold condition — each edge referenced by exactly 2 HEs with opposite orientation,\\nfeatures/19-rust-to-ts-typegen/final-review.md.log:6519:features/19